  "html": "<div id=\"question-44435\" class=\"question\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                        <div class=\"questionNumber\">Question 6</div>\n\n                        \n                               \n                         \n        \n\n                        \n\n                        <div id=\"questionText-44435\" class=\"questionText\">\n                            <p>Which of the following shows a plot of the line <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"31\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n                                     \n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                            <table class=\"choicesTable\">\n                                <tbody><tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceALetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-44435-choiceA\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"a\">a</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td class=\"choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-44435-a-1\"></td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\